<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine to auction T-bills on June 3.</title>
<headline>Ukraine to auction T-bills on June 3.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine's central bank will auction six-month, nine-month and 12-month discount Treasury bills on June 3, a bank official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The issue volume of six-month T-bills was set at 15.0 million hryvnias, while 38.0 million hryvnias' worth of nine-month paper will be on offer. The bank will also sell 60.0 million hryvnias of 12-month paper.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom, +38044 244 9150 ($1 = 1.8600 hryvnias)</p>
</text>
